<title>UK: CIC sets $70 mln step-up perpetual FRN.</title>
<headline>CIC sets $70 mln step-up perpetual FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CIE FINANCIERE (CIC)</p>
<p> AMT    $70 MLN	 SPREAD   * 70 BP     MATURITY ** PERPETUAL</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    16.OCT.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  100.173   FULL FEES   =</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    100.173</p>
<p> NOTES   * STEPS UP TO 145 B.P ON 16.OCT.01, 220 BP ON 16.OCT.06</p>
<p>	  ** CALL AT PAR ON 16.OCT.01 AND 16.OCT.06</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  FRANCE    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    22.5 BP   SELL CONC  40 BP     FULL FEES   62.5 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
